<title>USA: Price REIT sells Calif. shopping center.</title>
<headline>Price REIT sells Calif. shopping center.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Price REIT Inc said it sold its Cerritos, Calif., shopping center for $17,400,000, resulting in a net gain of about $4,200,000.</p>
<p>The center's budgeted net operating income for 1997 was $1,677,000.</p>
